{"strongs": "H8071", "word": "שִׂמְלָה", "translit": "sim.lah", "root": "שמל", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "wrapper, mantle", "definition": "שִׂמְלָה noun feminine wrapper, mantle ; — absolute ׳ שׂ Gen 9:23 +, construct שִׂמְלַת Deut 21:13 ; Deut 22:5 suffix שִׂמְלָֽתְךָ Deut 8:4 , etc.; plural שְׂמָלֹת Gen 45:22 (twice in verse) +, suffix שִׂמְלֹתָם Gen 44:13 +, etc.; — wrapper, mantle (of man or [ Ruth 3:3 +] woman), usually square piece of cloth worn as outer garment (see Mackie Hast. DB. i. 625 ; Benz Ency. Bib. iii. 2932 ), Gen 35:2 ; Exod 22:26 (both E ), Deut 8:4 ; Deut 10:18 ; Deut 21:13 ; Deut 22:3 ; Isa 3:6 ; Isa 3:7 ; Isa 9:4 ; 2Sam 12:20 Kt , Ruth 3:3 Kt ( Qr in both plural); as covering in sleep Gen 9:23 ( J ; compare Exod 22:26 ), bed-covering Deut 22:17 covering or receptacle for articles Exod 12:34 ( E ), Judg 8:25 ; 1Sam 21:10 , compare Prov 30:4 more generally garment , Deut 22:5 , clothes (plural) Gen 37:34 ; Gen 44:13 ( J ), Gen 41:14 ; Exod 19:10 ; Exod 19:14 (all E ), Josh 7:6 ( J E ); as costly gifts Gen 45:22 (twice in verse); Exod 3:22 ; Exod 12:35 (all E ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8262')\">BDB8262</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8071')\">H8071</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8261')\">BDB8261</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8263')\">BDB8263</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שִׂמְלָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>wrapper, mantle</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 9:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,23)\">Gen 9:23</ref> +, construct <bdbheb>שִׂמְלַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 21:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,13)\">Deut 21:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,5)\">Deut 22:5</ref> suffix <bdbheb>שִׂמְלָֽתְךָ</bdbheb> <r